The regexes in rules/gitleaks.json are mechanically converted from Go/RE2
syntax to JavaScript RegExp by scripts/build-gitleaks.mjs. Rules are graded
(`core` / `approx` / `loose`) by this project; that grading is not part of the
upstream data.
